  "solution": "Logic : (3rd number - 2nd number) ÷ 2 = 1st number\n\nGiven : \n\n__\n \n• (12, 5, 29)\n\n(**29 - 5**__) ÷ 2 = 12\n\n__**24 **____**÷ 2**__ = 12\n\n12 = 12 (LHS = RHS)\n\n__\n \n• (19, 12, 50)\n\n(**50 - 12**__) ÷ 2 = 19\n\n__**38 ÷ 2**__ = 19\n\n19 = 19 (LHS = RHS)\n\nSo,\n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : (8, 15, 21) \n\n(**21 - 15**__) ÷ 2 = 8\n\n__**6 **____**÷ 2**__ = 8\n\n3 ≠ 8 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (2) : (16, 12, 34) \n\n(**34 - 12**__) ÷ 2 = 16\n\n__**22 **____**÷ 2**__ = 16\n\n11 ≠ 16 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (3) : (15, 14, 44)\n\n(**44 - 14**__) ÷ 2 = 15\n\n__**30 **____**÷ 2**__ = 15\n\n**15 = 15 (LHS = RHS)**\n\n__\n \n• Option - (4) : (17, 11, 55) \n\n(**55 - 11**__) ÷ 2 = 17\n\n__**44 **____**÷ 2**__ = 17\n\n22 ≠ 17 (LHS ≠ RHS) \n\nHence, \"Option - (3)\" is the correct answer.",
